  description: 'During your Main Phase: You can destroy 1 DARK monster in your hand
    or face-up field, and if you do, add 1 "Yubel", or 1 card that mentions it, from
    your Deck to your hand, except "Nightmare Pain". You can only use this effect
    of "Nightmare Pain" once per turn. While you control a "Yubel" monster, your
    opponent''s monsters that can attack must attack "Yubel" monsters. Your opponent
    takes any battle damage you would have taken from battles involving your "Yubel"
    monsters.'
